{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":28,"alongside":29,"kin":30,"engines":55,"usedOn":56,"sites":57,"crewed":62,"museums":63,"hero":64},"https://www.orrerylearn.com/images/cards/fleet/beidou.jpg",{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_sites":24,"tagline":13,"description":27},"beidou","北斗 (北斗)","constellation","CNSA / China Satellite Navigation Office","China","CAST (China Academy of Space Technology)","2000-10-31","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","中国GNSS——2020年起全球运行；独特的MEO + IGSO + GEO混合架构","CNSA + China Satellite Navigation Office BeiDou-3 system. Spans MEO (24 sats) + IGSO (3 sats) + GEO (3 sats), unique hybrid architecture.",[16,20],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"BeiDou Navigation Satellite System — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/BeiDou","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"BeiDou official site","http://en.beidou.gov.cn/","core",[25],{"type":26,"site_id":3},"earth-object","中国的GNSS，当前形式正式称为北斗三号。采用独特的混合架构，结合MEO（24颗卫星，轨道高度21,500 km，倾角55°）、倾斜地球同步轨道（IGSO，3颗卫星）和GEO（3颗卫星）。于2020年7月宣布实现全球覆盖。唯一内置短报文卫星通信功能的GNSS——用户可以直接通过星座发送短文本消息，在偏远地区应急通信中非常实用。",[],[],[31,35,39,43,47,51],{"id":32,"name":33,"tagline":34},"tundra-sirius","Sirius Satellite Radio (Tundra) — 历史（2000-2016）","历史性商业Tundra轨道星座 — 2016年停运",{"id":36,"name":37,"tagline":38},"sbirs-heo","SBIRS-HEO","美国搭载于机密Tundra轨道平台的预警红外传感器",{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"inmarsat","Inmarsat","GEO 移动通信——海事、航空、GMDSS 主干网",{"id":44,"name":45,"tagline":46},"galileo-gnss","Galileo (GNSS)","欧洲民用GNSS — ~30颗卫星，亚米级定位",{"id":48,"name":49,"tagline":50},"o3b-mpower","O3b / O3b mPOWER（中地球轨道通信）","唯一运营的 MEO 商业宽带 — 20+ 颗卫星",{"id":52,"name":53,"tagline":54},"planet-labs","Planet Labs (PlanetScope + SkySat)","每日地球成像 — ~150 CubeSats + 21 SkySats",[],[],[58],{"type":26,"href":59,"name":60,"place":-1,"text":61},"/earth?id=beidou","北斗卫星导航系统","中国的全球导航卫星系统。46颗以上卫星分布在中地球轨道、地球同步轨道和倾斜地球同步轨道上。自2020年以来提供全球覆盖。还具有信息服务功能——卫星可中继短文本。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/beidou/01.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
